+## Knowledge boundary rollback
+
+The `/documents` delivery path depends on `Knowledge::Catalog.list(tenant_id:)`; persistence remains behind the Knowledge namespace. If this boundary needs to be rolled back, first restore the delivery adapter to its previous response implementation while retaining tenant authentication, then remove the Catalog adapter only after callers and characterization tests have been migrated. Do not change the `documents` table or records as part of rollback. Re-run the offline test suite and boundary checks before deploying the rollback.
